# ── Source data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~4 GB of public-record pulls and packed data modules. Not redistributed
# here: see data/README.md for where every field comes from and how to
# rebuild it. Some upstream feeds carry owner PII that must be stripped on
# ingest, which is another reason these do not belong in a public repo.
*_pool*.json
listings.json
us_*.json
data_*.js
raw/
geo/
pull/
panos/
ipfs/
deployment-task4/

